# Ignore files with no extension, then re-include the ones we ship.
*
!*/
!*.*
!LICENSE
!Dockerfile
!Dockerfile.replay-viewer

# Hidden files, but not the CI workflows or these two dotfiles.
.*
!.github/
!.github/**
!.gitignore
!.dockerignore

# The committed nim.cfg would pin the AUTHOR's package paths and is wrong on
# every other host: CI and the Dockerfile regenerate it from ~/.nimby/pkgs.
nim.cfg
nimcache
*.exe
*.out
out/
tmp/
build/
dist/
replay-viewer/dist/
tests/test_sokoban_*
!tests/test_sokoban_*.nim
tools/tune_baselines
tools/gen_wire_constants
wire_constants.js
viewer-smoke.png
viewer-smoke.json
fixture-evidence/
